# Comms public navigation

## Get started (progressive CTA)

**Get started** in Header resolves to `/onboarding` when Brand Kit is not established, otherwise `/guide/social-media-plan` (First week roadmap). Do **not** retarget Get started at `/brand-kit` once identity exists — Brand Kit stays its own top-level link.

Brand Kit is the Comms home base (colours, logo, local number, links). First week (`/guide/social-media-plan`) is the channel roadmap after identity — also listed under Guides → Start here and the home “What’s next” CTA.

## Header Guides menu (keep this shape)

Four groups in [`nav-config.ts`](src/components/layout/nav/nav-config.ts) `learnGroups` (trigger label **Guides**):

1. **Start here** — The Blueprint (`/guide`), First week (`/guide/social-media-plan`), Comms Resources (`/guide/resources`), Workshop outline (`/guide/workshop`), Strike Guide (`/guide/crisis`)
2. **By channel** — Print Guide (`/guide/print`), Union Boards Guide, Website Guide, Email & outreach (`/guide/email-broadcast`), Short-form video (`/guide/short-form`), Membership signup (`/guide/membership-signup`)
3. **Libraries** — Social Examples, Captions, Photo Consent (`/guide/photo-consent`)
4. **About** — Brand Assets (`/assets`), What's new (`/updates`), Built in solidarity (`/manifesto`), Install as an app (`/install`)

Do not re-flatten channel guides into a long top-level link bar. Do not invent marketing routes (`/about`, `/pricing`, `/blog`) unless product expands.

## Header Tools menu (keep this shape)

Four groups in `nav-config.ts` `toolGroups` (mega-menu columns). Group by **job** (what the steward is making), not by First week channel. Lesson: [`session-knowledge-2026-08-18-tools-catalog-ia.md`](../../docs/audit/session-knowledge-2026-08-18-tools-catalog-ia.md). Visual 4-col only at `2xl`; lg/xl stay 2-col and the panel is viewport-clamped (`flyout-geometry.ts`) so it cannot run off medium desktops.

1. **Brand** — Logo Builder, Resizer, Document & Slide Generator
2. **Union boards** — Board Banner & Trim, Board Notice Maker, Solidarity Posters, QR Board Posters
3. **Print & cards** — Flyer Maker, QR Link Cards, Action Cards, Pulse Poll (Hub-signed-in only)
4. **Social & web** — Graphic Maker, Quote Card, Meeting Backgrounds, Website Template, Alt-Text Assistant

Footer row in the mega-menu: **All tools** → `/tools` index. Do not re-flatten Tools into a single ungrouped list. Keep one **Tools ▾** trigger — do not add extra top-level tool links.

## Footer

Include Tools (`/tools`), Print Guide, **Email & outreach**, Blueprint / Examples / Captions / Resources, **Brand Assets**, **What's new**, **Built in solidarity**, **Install as an app**, Privacy, Accessibility, Support.

## Brand Assets

`/assets` lives under Guides → About and in the footer. Brand Kit may still link Brand Assets on-page.

## Auth chrome (session-aware)

When authenticated, the public header / mobile drawer always show **Officer Hub**, **Profile**, and **Sign out** (even if `NEXT_PUBLIC_OFFICER_HUB_PUBLIC` is false). When logged out, Officer Hub appears only if the hub is public. Profile photo capture lives at `/app/profile`.

## Keep out of public chrome

- Operator docs (`docs/guides/SETUP.md`, `DEPLOY.md`)
- Hub modules (use `HubNav`) — except the session-aware Officer Hub / Profile / Sign out controls above. Do **not** duplicate **Comms toolbox** inside `HubNav`; Tools / Guides / Brand Kit / the home mark already reach the public toolbox.
- Invented marketing routes (`/about`, `/pricing`, `/blog`) unless product expands. **What's new** (`/updates`) is the dated product-growth list, not a blog.

